{"channelId":"UC8NRN_7Mr-JSxMmKikTwb3A","row":["Priors Farm Equine Veterinary Surgery",1240,"Priors Farm Equine Surgery is situated in the village of Forest Row, East Sussex. Established in 1978 by Philip Glyn it was taken over in 2008 by Ben Chilvers and Duncan Harrison, and now comprises a team of six dedicated equine veterinary surgeons. Priors Farm Equine Vets have built a reputation for being caring and compassionate, and we aim to spend as much time as possible getting to know our patients and their owners to provide an unrivalled service. Along with a great reputation we have a purpose-built diagnostic and surgical facility with stabling. We can provide 24-hour nursing care when required. Surgery is performed by a world-class surgeon giving your horse the absolute best service available. Please visit www.priorsfarm.co.uk  to see the full range of services that we can provide for you and your horse.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8NRN_7Mr-JSxMmKikTwb3A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8NRN_7Mr-JSxMmKikTwb3A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:23.435Z","channelId":"UC8NRN_7Mr-JSxMmKikTwb3A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"30e1c28d90735cd011c58f6e750d4aa7061a9dbf445c6f693f0826243e06a453","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7d5ba4c7dac70830ce25ee1cab71c49e81b3b311a50f69cabf2ad223c6f76930"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8NRN_7Mr-JSxMmKikTwb3A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1240,"raw":"1.24K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8NRN_7Mr-JSxMmKikTwb3A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:23.435Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/chann